WEBVTT

01:16.576 --> 01:21.946
Episode 0
An Omen

01:29.656 --> 01:30.987
I see a dream.

01:32.092 --> 01:34.356
I see the future
inside the dream.

01:35.462 --> 01:37.259
The two Divine Swords.

01:37.364 --> 01:41.198
I also know that
two "Kamuis" will appear...

01:44.104 --> 01:45.867
I am Kakyou.

01:45.972 --> 01:49.203
A Dragon of Earth,
one of the Seven Angels.

01:49.309 --> 01:52.369
A dreamseer who sees
the future within dreams.

01:53.980 --> 01:55.914
Where did I come from?

01:56.016 --> 01:58.484
Why am I able
to know the future?

01:58.585 --> 02:01.179
And what meaning
does that have?

02:01.288 --> 02:03.449
All that means
nothing to me now...

02:04.558 --> 02:06.719
Everything has
already been lost.

02:07.794 --> 02:09.056
Back then...

02:09.162 --> 02:10.959
With the person
I cherished so much.

03:01.815 --> 03:02.713
Over there...

03:04.718 --> 03:06.276
Please let me make it...

03:08.889 --> 03:09.787
Hokuto...

03:11.024 --> 03:13.891
You shouldn't come here...

03:15.362 --> 03:17.694
If you come here...

03:17.797 --> 03:18.821
You'll...

03:20.400 --> 03:21.389
...be killed!

03:27.007 --> 03:28.668
You can't...

03:28.775 --> 03:30.572
Don't come here...

03:30.677 --> 03:33.009
What I saw in my dream...

03:33.113 --> 03:34.808
...will become reality.

03:51.765 --> 03:53.323
Hokuto...

03:53.433 --> 03:54.331
Run...

03:58.238 --> 03:59.227
Kakyou...

04:06.746 --> 04:07.644
Why...

04:09.716 --> 04:10.876
Why?

04:16.456 --> 04:17.582
Hokuto...

04:31.738 --> 04:32.864
My lady...

04:32.973 --> 04:34.167
It has finished.

04:35.275 --> 04:36.299
Is he dead?

04:37.410 --> 04:39.173
I believe it is
a matter of time...

04:39.279 --> 04:40.143
I see...

04:41.214 --> 04:43.842
Do whatever you can for him.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.848
Yes.

04:45.852 --> 04:46.819
That boy...

04:49.222 --> 04:53.124
...was born with the power
to see the future in his dreams.

04:53.226 --> 04:55.387
That was what was
so unfortunate about him.

04:55.495 --> 04:57.156
Everything is over.

04:57.263 --> 04:58.355
It's finished.

05:12.178 --> 05:13.805
Huh?

05:13.913 --> 05:14.971
Where is this?

05:16.182 --> 05:19.276
This isn't inside my dream...

05:20.820 --> 05:22.117
That means...

05:22.222 --> 05:24.156
...this is your dream?

05:24.257 --> 05:25.622
Correct...

05:25.725 --> 05:26.987
This is my dream.

05:28.428 --> 05:32.023
Why was I able
to come inside your dream?

05:32.132 --> 05:33.030
Why?

05:34.534 --> 05:36.468
Because I wanted
to see someone...

05:37.804 --> 05:40.238
Because I was alone
for all this time...

05:40.340 --> 05:41.739
I wanted to see...

05:41.841 --> 05:42.739
...someone.

05:45.345 --> 05:46.505
See someone?

05:46.613 --> 05:48.547
So anyone would have done?

05:48.648 --> 05:50.878
You can't possibly be
saying that...

05:50.984 --> 05:53.282
...with a cute girl
like me in front of you!

05:53.386 --> 05:54.444
Who are you?

05:54.554 --> 05:55.486
A dreamseer, maybe?

05:57.457 --> 05:58.890
That's what I thought.

05:58.992 --> 06:00.186
I've heard...

06:00.293 --> 06:03.160
...that people who can see
the future in their dreams exist.

06:03.263 --> 06:05.094
Are you surprised that I know?

06:05.198 --> 06:07.689
I grew up in a family
of spiritualists.

06:07.801 --> 06:09.530
Have you heard
of the Sumeragi clan?

06:09.636 --> 06:12.002
My little brother's
the head of it right now...

06:12.105 --> 06:14.335
I can't use most of the spells.

06:14.441 --> 06:16.102
No talent, I guess.

06:16.209 --> 06:18.643
But because I had
just a little bit of power...

06:18.745 --> 06:21.145
...I was able to
meet you like this.

06:21.247 --> 06:23.715
My name's Hokuto Sumeragi.

06:23.817 --> 06:25.284
What's yours?

06:25.385 --> 06:26.750
Kakyou...

06:26.853 --> 06:29.981
Kakyou Kuzuki.

06:30.090 --> 06:31.648
Kakyou, huh?

06:31.758 --> 06:33.851
So why have you
been alone all this time?

06:33.960 --> 06:35.757
You haven't gone
outside of there, either?

06:35.862 --> 06:37.625
Is that of your own will?

06:39.966 --> 06:41.024
It's not?

06:41.134 --> 06:42.465
Then it's easy!

06:42.569 --> 06:44.264
I'll take you out somewhere.

06:44.370 --> 06:45.997
Where do you want to go?

06:46.106 --> 06:47.266
Anywhere.

06:47.373 --> 06:49.102
That's no good!

06:49.209 --> 06:50.972
After all,
this is the first date!

06:52.045 --> 06:53.740
I want to see the sea.

06:54.848 --> 06:56.042
The sea?

06:56.149 --> 06:57.673
How about a sea like this?

07:06.126 --> 07:08.492
This is inside my dream.

07:08.595 --> 07:11.826
But the sea in real life
is more wonderful than this!

07:11.931 --> 07:14.923
Since we've gotten to know one
another well, I want to see you.

07:15.034 --> 07:17.229
Not in our dreams,
but the real Kakyou.

07:18.304 --> 07:21.501
I want to see you, too.
But...

07:21.608 --> 07:22.700
But?

07:22.809 --> 07:24.868
I can't go outside.

07:24.978 --> 07:25.876
Ever.

07:27.680 --> 07:30.080
Nothing is absolute in this world.

07:30.183 --> 07:31.582
It's all right!

07:31.684 --> 07:33.948
You have Hokuto Sumeragi
on your side!

07:34.988 --> 07:36.478
Well, let's go!

07:36.589 --> 07:37.954
Out of there and outside!

07:50.770 --> 07:53.398
Even if I see the future
where you die...

07:53.506 --> 07:55.269
...I couldn't do anything.

07:56.342 --> 07:58.936
Not even to protect
someone dear to me...

08:03.650 --> 08:05.811
That was the moment
my heart died.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.854
I won't do anything anymore.

08:08.955 --> 08:10.149
I can't feel anything.

08:11.457 --> 08:13.015
And...

08:13.126 --> 08:14.753
Just sleep...

08:14.861 --> 08:17.625
I will continue to see
the future in my dreams.

08:19.599 --> 08:22.659
The dream of the tragedy
to happen in the future.

08:23.770 --> 08:25.260
I just keep watching.

08:58.004 --> 09:00.370
The time of a new tragedy
is approaching.

09:01.641 --> 09:03.541
Guided by destiny...

09:03.643 --> 09:06.908
The Dragons of Heaven,
the Seven Seals...

09:07.013 --> 09:10.881
...and the Dragons of Earth,
the Seven Angels will gather.

09:12.652 --> 09:16.986
And the one who holds the key
to the fate of the world...

09:18.758 --> 09:19.656
Kamui.

09:33.773 --> 09:38.039
With the arrival of that boy,
everything will start to move...

09:39.312 --> 09:41.405
Towards the one and only future.

09:48.388 --> 09:50.913
The future is always... one.

09:52.392 --> 09:53.950
Nobody can change that.

09:55.728 --> 09:59.755
All I can do is know
the future in my dreams.

10:03.503 --> 10:07.963
I can't save even one soul
of the many that will be lost...

10:09.342 --> 10:11.003
...in the Final Battle.

10:12.679 --> 10:16.638
The destiny of all has
already been determined.

10:20.620 --> 10:21.917
Even if they meet...

10:22.021 --> 10:23.613
...are hurt...

10:23.723 --> 10:25.384
...and love one another.

10:26.492 --> 10:27.459
I promised you...

10:29.195 --> 10:32.255
...that when something
happens to you, I'll protect you.

10:33.833 --> 10:35.960
And that won't change, either.

10:36.069 --> 10:36.967
Ever.

10:39.605 --> 10:40.697
I've forgotten.

10:43.009 --> 10:44.442
You should forget it, too.

10:44.544 --> 10:46.944
And don't ever do things
you don't have to.

10:47.046 --> 10:48.741
That's our new promise.

10:48.848 --> 10:49.746
Kamui...

10:58.424 --> 11:00.289
I decided on you, missie.

11:03.896 --> 11:05.056
Decided?

11:05.164 --> 11:09.260
If I'm gonna decide,
I'd rather it be someone beautiful.

11:09.369 --> 11:10.927
Decided?

11:11.037 --> 11:12.163
What did you decide?

11:16.609 --> 11:18.543
The person I'd give my life for!

11:20.580 --> 11:22.639
Am I bothering
your amusement?

11:22.749 --> 11:24.910
No, I just finished.

11:26.119 --> 11:27.916
Then tell me, Satsuki.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.510
Is that boy the true "Kamui"?

11:30.757 --> 11:32.281
Beast answers yes.

11:34.460 --> 11:35.484
I see.

11:35.595 --> 11:37.654
So it finally begins.

11:37.764 --> 11:40.392
I'm sure "Kamui"
won't bore you.

11:50.176 --> 11:52.337
You smoke cigarettes?

11:52.445 --> 11:53.935
It's not good for your health.

11:56.015 --> 11:57.915
I've been looking
for you all this time.

11:58.017 --> 11:59.746
Why?

11:59.852 --> 12:02.047
To make my wish a reality.

12:03.089 --> 12:05.387
You're one of
the Dragons of Heaven...

12:05.491 --> 12:07.686
...trying to save
the Earth from destruction.

12:07.794 --> 12:11.491
I have no interest whatsoever
in the future of the Earth.

12:11.597 --> 12:14.395
Your wish... is to kill me?

12:15.501 --> 12:18.595
Me, the one who killed
your dear elder sister.

12:18.704 --> 12:21.104
You really are adorable, Subaru.

12:26.112 --> 12:27.841
That's a good dog.

12:27.947 --> 12:30.541
A strange dog, but a good dog.

12:32.885 --> 12:34.682
H-Hey...

12:34.787 --> 12:37.051
I-Is something wrong,
little lady?

12:37.156 --> 12:38.885
Did I do something bad?

12:40.693 --> 12:44.060
This is the first time I've met
someone who can see my Inuki.

12:45.198 --> 12:46.290
Answer me.

12:46.399 --> 12:48.833
Why can't we kill humans?

12:48.935 --> 12:51.699
Because humans are
stronger than other creatures?

12:51.804 --> 12:52.930
That's not it!

12:53.039 --> 12:56.304
If a creature is stronger,
is killing humans all right?

12:58.077 --> 12:58.941
That's not it...

12:59.045 --> 13:00.410
I'll ask you once more.

13:00.513 --> 13:02.777
Why can't we kill humans?

13:02.882 --> 13:03.678
Answer me.

13:04.951 --> 13:06.384
Inuki!

13:09.155 --> 13:11.089
That's a difficult question...

13:12.492 --> 13:13.925
Poor thing.

13:14.026 --> 13:15.721
That Dragon of Heaven girl...

13:15.828 --> 13:18.388
...was about to cry
because she couldn't answer.

13:18.498 --> 13:20.762
An answer based
on an ethical viewpoint.

13:20.867 --> 13:22.459
An idealistic answer.

13:22.568 --> 13:24.160
A biological answer.

13:25.671 --> 13:28.401
There are many things
that can serve as the answer.

13:28.508 --> 13:30.635
But none of them
are complete answers.

13:32.245 --> 13:33.576
What do you think, Yuto?

13:34.647 --> 13:36.410
Well, I think it's
probably because...

13:37.884 --> 13:39.545
...there are people
who would be sad.

13:41.921 --> 13:44.116
Nataku, what is your wish?

13:45.191 --> 13:46.783
I don't know.

13:46.893 --> 13:51.091
But I think I don't want
to be parted from you.

13:51.197 --> 13:52.755
Why?

13:52.865 --> 13:55.561
Because you look like... Dad.

13:58.004 --> 14:00.472
What did your father call you?

14:01.607 --> 14:02.471
Kazuki.

14:07.980 --> 14:11.074
There's no such thing as
a creature with no emotions.

14:11.183 --> 14:13.083
You just think that you don't.

14:14.854 --> 14:16.754
I'm the one who should go.

14:16.856 --> 14:20.189
You have a wife
and a lovely daughter.

14:20.293 --> 14:23.854
Kamui and the other
Seven Seals are still young...

14:23.963 --> 14:25.726
That's why I...

14:25.831 --> 14:27.162
Mr. Aoki!

14:27.266 --> 14:32.101
Do you really think that nobody
would cry for you if you died?

14:32.204 --> 14:33.865
I would cry.

14:34.941 --> 14:37.637
So there really were
two "Kamuis" after all.

14:37.743 --> 14:41.179
An accompanying star
born to fill the empty seat...

14:41.280 --> 14:44.909
...whichever side, heaven or earth,
the true Kamui falls to.

14:46.018 --> 14:50.318
Kamui chose to be a Dragon of Heaven,
one of the Seven Seals.

14:50.423 --> 14:52.721
So the other "Kamui" is mine.

14:54.260 --> 14:55.386
That is not so...

14:55.494 --> 14:58.258
The "Kamui" who is
a Dragon of Earth...

14:58.364 --> 15:01.094
...one of the Seven Angels,
is already close by.

15:02.201 --> 15:03.828
That is not so, Kanoe!

15:03.936 --> 15:08.464
Sister, I'll prove to you that
your dreamgazing was correct.

15:08.574 --> 15:09.438
Kanoe!

15:10.977 --> 15:12.376
Don't invite "Kamui" within!

15:14.347 --> 15:16.508
The Earth longs for a revolution.

15:17.883 --> 15:21.114
A revolution that humans
will not get in the way of.

15:22.955 --> 15:27.119
To do that, we will wipe out
all those who pollute the Earth.

15:30.963 --> 15:32.191
Big Brother...

15:45.444 --> 15:48.413
Tragedy will repeat
just like in the dreams.

15:48.514 --> 15:49.674
That is destiny.

15:50.783 --> 15:54.981
Everyone just
goes along its flow.

15:55.087 --> 15:56.486
There is only one future.

15:56.589 --> 15:57.521
Only but one.

16:04.263 --> 16:05.992
Is this what you wanted?

16:07.099 --> 16:07.997
Yes.

16:09.835 --> 16:13.464
Because you had the potential
to become a dreamseer...

16:13.572 --> 16:15.699
...I was able to cross
into your dreams.

16:16.809 --> 16:20.006
We have dreams even
at the moment of our death.

16:22.114 --> 16:24.514
I knew this would happen.

16:24.617 --> 16:25.515
But...

16:27.019 --> 16:30.250
...even if I know the future,
I can't do anything.

16:30.356 --> 16:33.382
The person who was
so dear to me... and you...

16:33.492 --> 16:35.426
I couldn't save either of you.

16:39.198 --> 16:40.392
Thank you, Kakyou.

16:41.967 --> 16:43.025
I have to go now.

16:58.951 --> 17:00.248
Kakyou...

17:00.352 --> 17:03.549
If you see my big brother
and Kamui, please tell them...

17:06.025 --> 17:08.960
...that I love both of them.

17:10.663 --> 17:11.687
And...

17:12.765 --> 17:16.792
...that the future still
hasn't been determined.

17:21.407 --> 17:25.036
That the future still
hasn't been determined.

17:28.180 --> 17:29.807
No.

17:29.915 --> 17:31.644
It's already been determined.

17:33.486 --> 17:36.011
The moment I became
a Dragon of Earth.

17:38.023 --> 17:40.321
You should see that
if you're a dreamseer.

17:53.405 --> 17:55.635
There is only one future.

17:59.378 --> 18:00.902
Kakyou.

18:01.013 --> 18:02.537
Come with me.

18:03.682 --> 18:06.617
And weave dreams for me.

18:17.930 --> 18:22.026
Even now, I continue to see
the future within my dreams...

18:23.636 --> 18:26.070
...though knowing
I can't do anything about it.

18:27.940 --> 18:30.238
Even so, I still wish...

18:31.544 --> 18:34.604
...that the words that girl
told me were correct.

18:36.382 --> 18:37.508
Also...

18:37.616 --> 18:41.017
...that I can once again
regain the courage...

18:41.120 --> 18:43.452
...that the person
I cherished so much gave me.

18:44.523 --> 18:46.457
Nothing is absolute in this world.

18:47.693 --> 18:49.183
It's all right!

18:49.295 --> 18:51.820
You have Hokuto Sumeragi
on your side!

18:52.932 --> 18:54.490
Well, let's go!

18:54.600 --> 18:56.363
Out of there and outside!

19:50.155 --> 19:55.957
In the world of sad dreams...

19:57.062 --> 20:01.726
With nobody to love...

20:02.835 --> 20:08.796
If I can't even stop living...

20:09.909 --> 20:15.370
...what can I do?

20:17.616 --> 20:22.815
I loved and I lost everything...

20:24.323 --> 20:28.760
...but yet I still searched.

20:30.262 --> 20:36.132
The beauty of
continuing to protect...

20:37.202 --> 20:42.663
...but that is just an illusion.

20:48.414 --> 20:54.114
Your strength and kindness...

20:54.219 --> 21:00.783
...may be able to protect
the true emotions.

21:02.094 --> 21:07.794
People's hearts can change...

21:07.900 --> 21:15.102
...so I want to believe it
so that I can live tomorrow.

21:16.308 --> 21:20.711
Don't cry anymore.

21:21.747 --> 21:27.652
I'm here with you.

21:29.621 --> 21:35.287
Right now,
only the uncertain future...

21:35.394 --> 21:42.027
...sends our hearts into confusion.

21:43.268 --> 21:49.002
But because people's hearts
can change...

21:49.108 --> 21:56.241
...I won't give up on
something I hold dear ever again.

21:57.416 --> 22:08.691
Now, I can live without worries.

22:10.262 --> 22:15.723
Now, don't cry.

22:16.902 --> 22:24.968
Let's start walking right now.
